  "coverImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/wordmark.svg?sanitize=true",
  "readTime": 1,
  "content": "<p>AG-UI: the Agent-User Interaction Protocol. Bring Agents into Frontend Applications.</p><p><img alt=\"link\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png\" style=\"margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"20\"/><a href=\"https://ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://ag-ui.com</a></p><hr/><div align=\"center\">\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"AG-UI\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/wordmark.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"320\"/></a></p>\n<h3>The open protocol that connects any agent to any app.</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ag-ui/core\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"npm version\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/%40ag-ui%2Fcore?logo=npm&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=npm&amp;color=6963ff\"/></a> <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ag-ui/core\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"npm weekly downloads\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/dw/%40ag-ui%2Fcore?logo=npm&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=downloads&amp;color=6963ff\"/></a> <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/ag-ui-protocol/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"PyPI version\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/pypi/v/ag-ui-protocol?logo=pypi&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=pypi&amp;color=6963ff\"/></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jd3FzfdJa8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Discord\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1379082175625953370?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=discord&amp;color=6963ff\"/></a> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"License: MIT\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-6963ff\"/></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a></strong> · <strong><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Examples</a></strong> · <strong><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spec</a></strong> · <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jd3FzfdJa8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/talk-to-us\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Running AG-UI in production? Talk to the team\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/talk-to-the-team.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"400\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://trendshift.io/repositories/27961?utm_source=repository-badge&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-repository-27961\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ag-ui-protocol%2Fag-ui | Trendshift\" height=\"55\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/27961\" width=\"250\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<p><strong>AG-UI is an open, lightweight, event-based protocol that standardizes how AI agents connect to user-facing applications.</strong></p>\n<p>Agents don't fit the request/response model. They stream tokens, call tools mid-response, update shared state, pause for a human, and spawn subagents, and every framework does it differently. AG-UI replaces that custom wiring with one bi-directional event stream: the agent emits typed events, and any client can render them, no matter which framework built the agent. The same agent can power a web app, a mobile app, a terminal, or Slack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"AG-UI connects any agent to any app: web apps, mobile, Slack and Teams, and terminal clients connect bi-directionally through AG-UI to agents built with LangChain, CrewAI, Mastra, Google ADK, Microsoft Agent Framework, Pydantic AI or any framework, with streaming chat, generative UI, shared state, human in the loop, frontend tools and subagents; AG-UI works alongside MCP for tools and A2A for agents.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/overview.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"880\"/></a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">\n<svg class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path>\n</svg>Important</p>\n<p><strong>AG-UI 1.0 is here.</strong> The protocol now has a stable, frozen <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">specification</a> backed by a JSON Schema, and the TypeScript, Python, and .NET SDKs are generated from it. 1.0 is backwards compatible in both directions: 0.x agents work with 1.0 clients and vice versa. <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/changelog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What changed →</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/migrating-to-1-0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Migration guide →</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Quick start</h2>\n<p><strong>Start a new app.</strong> The CLI scaffolds a frontend (<a href=\"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CopilotKit</a> on Next.js, or a terminal client) wired to the agent framework you pick:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx create-ag-ui-app@latest\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then follow the printed next steps. The generated templates call OpenAI, so set your key before <code>npm run dev</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">export OPENAI_API_KEY=\"sk-...\"\n</code></pre>\n<details>\n<b>Or speak the protocol directly: a 30-line agent server and client</b>\n<br/>\n<p>An AG-UI agent is any HTTP endpoint that accepts a <code>RunAgentInput</code> and streams events back. No API keys needed for this one.</p>\n<p><strong>1. The agent (Python).</strong> Requires Python 3.9+.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">pip install ag-ui-protocol fastapi uvicorn\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\"># server.py\nimport uuid\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, Request\nfrom fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse\nfrom ag_ui.core import (\n    PROTOCOL_VERSION,\n    RunAgentInput,\n    RunStartedEvent,\n    RunFinishedEvent,\n    TextMessageStartEvent,\n    TextMessageContentEvent,\n    TextMessageEndEvent,\n)\nfrom ag_ui.encoder import EventEncoder\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n@app.post(\"/\")\nasync def run_agent(input_data: RunAgentInput, request: Request):\n    encoder = EventEncoder(accept=request.headers.get(\"accept\"))\n\n    async def events():\n        yield encoder.encode(RunStartedEvent(\n            thread_id=input_data.thread_id,\n            run_id=input_data.run_id,\n            protocol_version=PROTOCOL_VERSION,\n        ))\n        message_id = str(uuid.uuid4())\n        yield encoder.encode(TextMessageStartEvent(message_id=message_id, role=\"assistant\"))\n        for chunk in [\"Hello \", \"from \", \"AG-UI!\"]:\n            yield encoder.encode(TextMessageContentEvent(message_id=message_id, delta=chunk))\n        yield encoder.encode(TextMessageEndEvent(message_id=message_id))\n        yield encoder.encode(RunFinishedEvent(thread_id=input_data.thread_id, run_id=input_data.run_id))\n\n    return StreamingResponse(events(), media_type=encoder.get_content_type())\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">uvicorn server:app --port 8000\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>2. The client (TypeScript).</strong> In a second terminal, in a new folder. Requires Node.js 20+.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm init -y &amp;&amp; npm pkg set type=module\nnpm install @ag-ui/client tsx\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">// client.ts\nimport { HttpAgent } from \"@ag-ui/client\";\n\nconst agent = new HttpAgent({ url: \"http://localhost:8000/\" });\n\nagent.addMessage({ id: crypto.randomUUID(), role: \"user\", content: \"Hi there!\" });\n\nawait agent.runAgent({}, {\n  onRunStartedEvent: ({ event }) =&gt; console.log(`run started (AG-UI ${event.protocolVersion})`),\n  onTextMessageContentEvent: ({ event }) =&gt; { process.stdout.write(event.delta); },\n  onRunFinishedEvent: () =&gt; console.log(\"\\nrun finished\"),\n});\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx tsx client.ts\n</code></pre>\n<p>You should see <code>Hello from AG-UI!</code> stream in. Swap the server for any <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/#integrations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supported framework</a> and the client doesn't change.</p>\n</details>\n<h2>Where AG-UI fits</h2>\n<p><img alt=\"Diagram showing where AG-UI fits: a user works in your app, which connects to your agent through AG-UI (agent to user), while the agent reaches tools and data through MCP and other agents through A2A; a single agent often uses all three.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/protocol-stack.svg?sanitize=true\"/></p>\n<p>AG-UI is one of three open, complementary agentic protocols. <strong>MCP</strong> gives agents tools and context, <strong>A2A</strong> lets agents work with other agents, and <strong>AG-UI</strong> brings agents to users. A single agent often uses all three, and AG-UI can front agents that speak MCP or A2A. <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/agentic-protocols\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read more →</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">\n<svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path>\n</svg>Note</p>\n<p><strong>AG-UI or A2UI?</strong> They work together. <a href=\"https://github.com/google/A2UI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A2UI</a>, MCP Apps, and Open-JSON-UI are <em>generative UI specs</em>: they describe what UI an agent wants to show. AG-UI is the <em>runtime protocol</em> that carries those payloads, along with everything else, between the agent and the app. <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/concepts/generative-ui-specs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more →</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Integrations</h2>\n<p>AG-UI is adopted by Google, Microsoft, Amazon, and Oracle, and built into most agent frameworks. Every framework below has a live demo in the <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dojo</a>.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"LangChain logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/langchain.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>LangChain</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/langgraph/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"CrewAI logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/crewai.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>CrewAI</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/crewai-flows\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/crewai/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Microsoft Agent Framework logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/microsoft-agent-framework.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Microsoft Agent Framework</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/microsoft-agent-framework\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/microsoft-agent-framework-python/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Google ADK logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/google-adk.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Google ADK</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/adk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/adk-middleware/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"AWS Strands Agents logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/aws-strands.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>AWS Strands Agents</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/aws-strands\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/aws-strands/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Mastra logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/mastra.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Mastra</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/mastra/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/mastra/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Pydantic AI logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/pydantic-ai.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Pydantic AI</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/pydantic-ai/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/pydantic-ai/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"LlamaIndex logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/llamaindex.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>LlamaIndex</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/llamaindex/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/llama-index/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Agno logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/agno.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Agno</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/agno/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/agno/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"AG2 logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/ag2.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>AG2</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/ag2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/ag2/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><img alt=\"Claude Agent SDK logo\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/logos/claude-agent-sdk.svg?sanitize=true\" width=\"40\"/><br/><b>Claude Agent SDK</b><br/><sub><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/claude-agent-sdk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/claude-agent-sdk-python/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><br/><b><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/integrations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">+11 more</a></b><br/><sub>Antigravity, OpenAI Agents, watsonx, Spring AI, and others in the <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/#full-list-of-integrations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">full list</a></sub></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Protocols:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/a2a-protocol\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A2A</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/middlewares/mcp-middleware\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MCP</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/generative-ui-specs/mcp-apps\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MCP Apps</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/middlewares/a2ui-middleware\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A2UI</a><br/> <strong>Clients:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CopilotKit</a> (React, Angular, Vue, React Native) · <a href=\"https://github.com/CopilotKit/channels-sdk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Slack &amp; Teams</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/quickstart/clients\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Terminal</a> · <a href=\"https://open.bot/builders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenBot</a></p>\n<p>Don't see your framework? <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/quickstart/introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Build an integration →</a></p>\n<h3>Full list of integrations</h3>\n<details>\n<b>Show all integrations</b>\n<br/>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Partners:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/langgraph/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LangChain</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/crewai-flows\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CrewAI</a></li>\n<li><strong>Built in:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/microsoft-agent-framework\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Agent Framework</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/adk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google ADK</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/integrations/google-adk-js\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JS</a>) · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/google-antigravity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/aws-strands\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Strands Agents</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/mastra/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mastra</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/pydantic-ai/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pydantic AI</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/agno/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Agno</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/llamaindex/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LlamaIndex</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.copilotkit.ai/ag2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AG2</a></li>\n<li><strong>More frameworks:</strong> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/claude-agent-sdk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Agent SDK</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/claude-managed-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Managed Agents</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/watsonx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IBM watsonx Orchestrate</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/langroid\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Langroid</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/community/spring-ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spring AI</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/community/cloudflare-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cloudflare Agents</a> · <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/integrations/omnara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Omnara</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/community/genkit/go\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Genkit (Go)</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/openai-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI Agents</a></li>\n<li><strong>Specs:</strong> <a href=\"https://go.copilotkit.ai/copilotkit-oracle-docs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle Agent Spec</a></li>\n<li><strong>Deployment:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock-agentcore/latest/devguide/runtime-agui.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Bedrock AgentCore</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Source for every integration lives in <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>integrations/</code></a> and <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/middlewares\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>middlewares/</code></a>, and the demos in <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/apps/dojo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>apps/dojo</code></a>.</p>\n</details>\n<h2>SDKs</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Language</th>\n<th>Install</th>\n<th>Reference</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TypeScript</strong></td>\n<td><code>npm install @ag-ui/client</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/sdk/js/core/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/typescript\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Python</strong></td>\n<td><code>pip install ag-ui-protocol</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/sdk/python/core/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/python\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>.NET</strong></td>\n<td><code>dotnet add package AGUI.Client</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/sdk/dotnet/client/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/dotnet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Community SDKs:</strong> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/kotlin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kotlin</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/go\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Go</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/java\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Java</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/dart\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dart</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/rust\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rust</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/ruby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ruby</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/c++\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">C++</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/sdks/community/swift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Swift</a></p>\n<h2>Features: what you can build</h2>\n<p>Each building block maps to events in the spec, and each has a live demo in the <a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AG-UI Dojo</a>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Building block</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n<th>Try it</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Streaming chat</strong></td>\n<td>Token-by-token messages across multi-turn sessions, with cancel and resume</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/agentic_chat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Generative UI</strong></td>\n<td>Agents render typed components, or declarative UI with <a href=\"https://github.com/google/A2UI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A2UI</a> and MCP Apps</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/tool_based_generative_ui\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shared state</strong></td>\n<td>A typed store the agent and app both read and write, synced with snapshots and JSON Patch deltas</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/shared_state\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Frontend tools</strong></td>\n<td>The agent calls tools that run in the app, and gets the result back</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/human_in_the_loop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Human in the loop</strong></td>\n<td>Runs end with an <code>interrupt</code> outcome; the user approves, edits, or rejects, and the next run resumes</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/mastra/feature/interrupt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Reasoning</strong></td>\n<td>Show the agent's reasoning as it works, including encrypted reasoning round-trips</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/agentic_chat_reasoning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Subagents</strong></td>\n<td>Nested delegation, with every event attributed to the subagent run that produced it</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/deepagents_subagents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Multimodal</strong></td>\n<td>Images, audio, video, and documents in user input and tool results</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://dojo.ag-ui.com/langgraph-fastapi/feature/agentic_chat_multimodal\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Tool output streaming, backend tool rendering, activity progress, token usage, and custom events are covered in the <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/concepts/events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">docs</a>. Here's a quick tour of the Dojo:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c298eea8-3f39-4a94-b968-7712429b0c49\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c298eea8-3f39-4a94-b968-7712429b0c49</a></p>\n<h2>How it works</h2>\n<p><img alt=\"Diagram of how AG-UI works: your app (CopilotKit, React, mobile, terminal, Slack or any client) sends a single RunAgentInput with messages, tools, state and context to your agent (LangChain, CrewAI, Mastra, Google ADK, Pydantic AI or any framework), and the agent streams back typed AG-UI events for lifecycle, text messages, tool calls, state, reasoning, activity, subagents, and custom and raw data, over any transport such as SSE, WebSockets or HTTP binary (Protobuf).\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/.github/readme/how-it-works.svg?sanitize=true\"/></p>\n<p>Your app starts a run by sending the agent a single <code>RunAgentInput</code>: the conversation, the tools the frontend offers, shared state, and context. The agent answers with a stream of typed events from eight families: run lifecycle, text messages, tool calls, state, reasoning, activity, subagents, and custom events (<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/#event-reference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">full list</a>). Only the run lifecycle is required, so a minimal agent emits a handful of events and grows from there.</p>\n<p>AG-UI is transport-agnostic. The spec defines <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/basic/transports/http-sse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HTTP + SSE</a> and a binary <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/basic/transports/http-protobuf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HTTP + Protobuf</a> binding, and middleware can adapt events from any source. Read the <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/concepts/architecture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">architecture overview</a> for the full picture.</p>\n<h2>Event reference</h2>\n<p>AG-UI 1.0 defines 31 event types in eight families. See the <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">spec</a> for every field.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Event family</th>\n<th>Events</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/lifecycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Runs and steps</a></td>\n<td><code>RUN_STARTED</code> <code>RUN_FINISHED</code> <code>RUN_ERROR</code> <code>STEP_STARTED</code> <code>STEP_FINISHED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/text-messages\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Text messages</a></td>\n<td><code>TEXT_MESSAGE_START</code> <code>TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT</code> <code>TEXT_MESSAGE_END</code> <code>TEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/tool-calls\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tool calls</a></td>\n<td><code>TOOL_CALL_START</code> <code>TOOL_CALL_ARGS</code> <code>TOOL_CALL_END</code> <code>TOOL_CALL_RESULT</code> <code>TOOL_CALL_CHUNK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/state\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">State</a></td>\n<td><code>STATE_SNAPSHOT</code> <code>STATE_DELTA</code> (JSON Patch) <code>MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/reasoning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Reasoning</a></td>\n<td><code>REASONING_START</code> <code>REASONING_MESSAGE_*</code> <code>REASONING_ENCRYPTED_VALUE</code> <code>REASONING_END</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/activity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Activity</a></td>\n<td><code>ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT</code> <code>ACTIVITY_DELTA</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/subagents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Subagents</a></td>\n<td><code>SUBAGENT_STARTED</code> <code>SUBAGENT_FINISHED</code> <code>SUBAGENT_ERROR</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/1.0/events/passthrough\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Passthrough</a></td>\n<td><code>RAW</code> <code>CUSTOM</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Community</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Questions and ideas:</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jd3FzfdJa8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/discussions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Discussions</a></li>\n<li><strong>Bugs:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Issues</a></li>\n<li><strong>What's next:</strong> the <a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/ag-ui-protocol/projects/1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadmap</a> and the <a href=\"https://docs.ag-ui.com/spec/draft\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">draft spec</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Contributing</h2>\n<p>Contributions are welcome: new integrations, SDKs, docs, and fixes. Start with <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, and use the <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/integrations/server-starter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">server starter</a> and <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/middlewares/middleware-starter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">middleware starter</a> as templates for new integrations. Report security issues as described in <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/SECURITY.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SECURITY.md</a>.</p>\n<p>AG-UI was created by <a href=\"https://copilotkit.ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CopilotKit</a> and is developed in the open with the community.</p>\n<h2>License</h2>\n<p>AG-UI is open source under the <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIT License</a>.</p>",
